text Next, I see a floor.
text I'm staring straight at it.
text What was it? I feel like I was in the middle of something.
text I move my "head" up to change views.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG301"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s13
fi
goto 14
label s13
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 14
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I see her.
text The girl that's been watching me.
text Her hand extends to me.
text I reach my own "hand" out toward it.
text Our hands overlap.
text While I can't feel anything... I still know they're together.
text As this happens, I realize something:
text I really have been born into this world.
text I've ended up existing after all.
text She can touch me.
text It's a sad world.
text But she's kind.
text When I touch her hand, both sadness and kindness fill my "heart" at the same time.
text I was born into this place because I sought her.
text ...Sacrificing my life in a new world, the happiness I could have had, and everything else.
text She pulls my hand up so that I can stand, and then leaves my side again.
text Once she's a few steps ahead of me, she claps her hands.
text I begin walking toward her.
text That's right... I was practicing walking; that's what I was doing before.
text My memory is sluggish.
text I can't remember anything without working to do so.
text She's clapping her hands, still.
text I should go.
text But my legs don't move the way I want them to.
text I fall forward yet again.
text But even so, she takes my hand once more and pulls me to my feet.
text How many times have I tried to walk?
text Finally, I manage to reach her.
text She holds my body, no more than half the height of hers, in her arms.
text ..."You did a good job."
text Warmth.
text This world's one source of warmth.
text The warmth that I sought.
text Though my body of scrap can't feel the warmth of hers.
text I look up at her face.
text There are so many things I want to ask her.
text But I have no mouth, so I can't speak.
text I turn my "face" to the window.
text A light is constantly shining in through it.
text I want to see the outside world.
text I want to see the end of the world for myself, with my own "eyes."
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
